{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fPVzLSqtKw1793348236.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一名男子早上在地盤內跌倒，被一支鋼筋插穿下巴，清醒送往威爾斯親王醫院治理。</p><p></p><p>約40多歲男子，由救護員送院治理。據了解，他是資深結構工程師。涉事地盤位於上水青曉路，是房委會地盤，承辦商是金門建築。勞工處及警方到場調查。</p><p></p><p>事發在早上約11時，男工程師在地盤與另外三名工程師檢查鋼筋，他當時站在木板平台，期間懷疑失足，跌向一支鋼筋，直接插穿下顎。案件暫列作工業意外。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:04:00.413330+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":180,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T07:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T09:39:07.116121+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:06.863918+00:00","content_hash":"81572bfa69dfdefe3f33adee2136c0a15d34b6601e27994135bbe6829d56363e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}